WEBVTT

00:43.043 --> 00:46.464
CHAPTER 1:
I AM A WEB NOVEL WRITER

00:52.636 --> 00:55.765
Yeon-hui had been friends with Ho
since childhood.

00:55.848 --> 00:56.682
HO
BITTER-SWEET HEART

00:56.766 --> 00:58.976
He's a man of few words and can be blunt,

00:59.059 --> 01:01.729
but the way he takes care of her
makes her heart swoon.

01:02.605 --> 01:03.939
She met Jin in college.

01:04.565 --> 01:05.691
JIN
RAY OF SUNSHINE

01:05.775 --> 01:08.277
He's so sweet you'd think he's an angel.

01:09.236 --> 01:10.821
Fans are split between

01:11.655 --> 01:14.116
shipping YeonHo

01:14.909 --> 01:17.411
and YeonJin

01:17.495 --> 01:18.621
as the ultimate couple.

01:19.538 --> 01:20.664
But personally…

01:27.463 --> 01:29.298
I told you never to show your face again.

01:29.840 --> 01:32.718
You drive me so crazy I can't stand it.

01:33.344 --> 01:34.178
Why?

01:34.970 --> 01:36.013
Why on earth?

01:39.517 --> 01:41.685
Why couldn't we have met sooner?

01:43.312 --> 01:44.772
…I'm all in on HoJin.

01:46.816 --> 01:49.485
-Idiot.
-The desperation in their eyes

01:49.568 --> 01:51.237
from having to hide their true feelings.

02:01.539 --> 02:02.373
Sorry.

02:04.625 --> 02:05.459
Hello, dad.

02:06.418 --> 02:07.253
What did you say?

02:07.336 --> 02:09.380
I've decided to remarry Geum-yeong.

02:09.463 --> 02:11.423
From now on, you and Ho are brothers.

02:13.467 --> 02:15.302
I hope you'll get along
as well as you do now.

02:20.182 --> 02:21.392
Hang on a moment.

02:23.102 --> 02:25.229
I can't take this anymore.

02:25.312 --> 02:26.689
Are you out of your mind?

02:29.817 --> 02:30.943
Hey! I'm talking to you!

02:32.820 --> 02:33.654
Sorry?

02:33.737 --> 02:35.865
Didn't you say this is the last episode?

02:38.158 --> 02:40.411
-Right.
-Yet you're pulling this kind of crap?

02:40.494 --> 02:43.455
I've put up with everything so far,
but the story is dragging so much.

02:43.539 --> 02:47.334
How can they only find out
they like each other in the last episode?

02:47.418 --> 02:49.962
And then out of the blue
they become brothers?

02:50.546 --> 02:51.422
What a crock!

02:51.505 --> 02:55.092
Well, we might get a season two.

02:56.343 --> 02:57.177
Are you insane?

02:57.261 --> 03:00.389
You think you'll get a season two
after this nonsense?

03:00.472 --> 03:03.559
Nobody even wants to read your novel!

03:04.810 --> 03:06.145
That's harsh.

03:06.896 --> 03:07.813
Is that her?

03:08.397 --> 03:11.317
The hack author whose characters,
plot, structure and writing

03:11.400 --> 03:14.153
are all a complete mess?

03:28.292 --> 03:29.293
Where is she?

03:30.085 --> 03:31.545
-Over there.
-Arrest her.

03:38.052 --> 03:40.137
Hands up! Step away from the keyboard!

03:40.220 --> 03:41.263
Don't touch that!

03:41.347 --> 03:42.806
-What…
-Hands in the air!

03:43.307 --> 03:45.309
What did I do?

03:45.392 --> 03:48.062
You know as well as anyone
how much your novel sucks.

03:49.229 --> 03:51.440
Writing a novel that sucks

03:53.233 --> 03:54.818
isn't a crime!

03:54.902 --> 03:56.111
Oh, yes it is!

03:57.363 --> 03:59.031
Article 1, Clause 1 of the Web Novel Act.

03:59.114 --> 04:01.450
Boring authors shall be punished.

04:01.533 --> 04:02.910
Accordingly, Yeo Eui-ju,

04:03.661 --> 04:04.828
I'm arresting you.

04:04.912 --> 04:05.996
No. You can't.

04:07.081 --> 04:08.499
No.

04:08.582 --> 04:11.502
No!

04:21.971 --> 04:23.681
I really thought I'd been arrested.

04:28.394 --> 04:31.021
PAZER WEB NOVEL PORTAL

04:38.070 --> 04:39.321
I'm…

04:39.405 --> 04:40.948
PAZER WEB NOVEL PORTAL

04:41.532 --> 04:42.449
…a writer.

04:45.119 --> 04:46.996
My genre is…

04:47.913 --> 04:49.999
BL.

04:50.082 --> 04:51.375
BL: ABBREVIATION OF BOYS' LOVE

04:51.458 --> 04:53.043
PRIZE
WRITING CONTEST

04:54.545 --> 04:55.838
My pen name is

04:57.047 --> 04:57.965
Imuk.

04:59.717 --> 05:01.093
My novel…

05:01.176 --> 05:02.845
THEY CAME TOGETHER

05:02.928 --> 05:04.388
…has only been read by me.

05:05.973 --> 05:08.809
The one with two views
was just a random click.

05:10.185 --> 05:13.313
They could've at least
left a snarky comment.

05:14.398 --> 05:16.608
ZERO REVIEWS

05:23.824 --> 05:24.783
Yeo Eui-do.

05:26.076 --> 05:28.495
The only person
who knows I write BL web novels.

05:29.621 --> 05:30.622
Coke.

05:30.706 --> 05:32.124
YEO EUI-DO
COKE ADDICT BROTHER

05:32.916 --> 05:35.169
He's using it to blackmail me.

05:38.964 --> 05:41.759
EPISODE 1

05:46.805 --> 05:48.891
What am I going to write next?

05:50.517 --> 05:52.728
I can't afford another bomb.

06:15.125 --> 06:17.669
Your leg must be sore. It's really tight.

06:17.753 --> 06:18.962
Did you shower?

06:19.046 --> 06:20.672
You smell great.

06:20.756 --> 06:22.091
Is that what I bought for you?

06:25.385 --> 06:28.263
You're so tense. We'd better keep at it.

06:32.267 --> 06:33.769
Get up.

06:33.852 --> 06:35.020
Let's work on your top.

06:35.104 --> 06:36.355
Not here!

06:36.438 --> 06:37.981
Then let's go inside.

06:39.441 --> 06:42.069
It's too early for that!

06:44.988 --> 06:46.532
Did you sleep well last night?

06:47.407 --> 06:49.368
I couldn't sleep at all because of you.

06:50.410 --> 06:51.537
Because you weren't there.

06:54.623 --> 06:56.041
Tonight,

06:56.125 --> 06:57.793
-I don't want to be alone.
-I don't want to be alone.

07:11.306 --> 07:12.432
What's up with her?

07:12.516 --> 07:13.684
Is she here for me?

07:14.309 --> 07:16.436
-Wasn't that a dude?
-It was a girl.

07:17.271 --> 07:19.273
-Are your eyes okay?
-They're fine.

07:19.356 --> 07:20.607
What's up with Dong-ju?

07:20.691 --> 07:21.525
He got a cramp.

07:21.608 --> 07:22.734
Why did Gi-jeon carry him?

07:22.818 --> 07:23.861
For the exercise.

07:26.155 --> 07:28.657
CHAPTER 2:
DO YOU KNOW WHY STUDENTS WEAR UNIFORMS?

07:28.740 --> 07:30.826
EUI-JU'S HOUSE
SHIN, YOON-JU, EUI-JU, EUI-DO, SUNI

07:35.038 --> 07:36.623
Hey, mom,

07:36.707 --> 07:40.002
have the twins who used to live
at the white house move away?

07:41.086 --> 07:42.004
Have they?

07:43.380 --> 07:46.425
It looks like a bunch of guys
have moved in.

07:46.508 --> 07:47.384
Really?

07:48.010 --> 07:50.888
I heard the twins' dad got promoted.
Maybe he transferred to HQ.

07:50.971 --> 07:52.431
Why didn't they say goodbye?

07:54.141 --> 07:55.100
What about us?

07:55.934 --> 07:57.519
When are we moving?

07:59.188 --> 08:00.272
Don't you like it here?

08:01.148 --> 08:02.608
I turned down a promotion.

08:07.779 --> 08:09.907
Eat up.

08:15.746 --> 08:16.830
Pervert!

08:21.251 --> 08:22.669
I'm done.

08:25.464 --> 08:26.715
Have some more.

08:26.798 --> 08:29.009
If I have more, I'll be late.

08:31.011 --> 08:32.554
See you later.

08:33.972 --> 08:36.016
-Have a good day!
-Watch out for cars!

08:40.979 --> 08:42.022
I said I'd go by myself.

08:42.105 --> 08:45.025
Why are you being so stubborn?
Let's go together.

08:45.108 --> 08:47.361
I hate the smell
of the air freshener in that car.

08:48.487 --> 08:49.780
Hang on.

08:54.368 --> 08:55.285
I'll go with you.

08:56.036 --> 08:58.038
Forget it. Mind your own business.

08:58.121 --> 08:59.414
What's this?

08:59.498 --> 09:01.250
Isn't that those guys from yesterday?

09:01.333 --> 09:02.501
Hey, Ga Woo-su!

09:06.004 --> 09:07.339
I can't.

09:09.633 --> 09:11.927
-You know I can't.
-Give it a rest!

09:12.010 --> 09:13.762
Unbelievable!

09:14.513 --> 09:15.389
You're annoying me.

09:16.098 --> 09:16.974
A lovers' spat?

09:17.557 --> 09:19.184
Just listen to me. Please.

09:21.019 --> 09:22.604
Until when?

09:23.313 --> 09:25.565
Let's just take the car and make it easy.

09:25.649 --> 09:27.818
How long do I have to do what you want?

09:27.901 --> 09:28.902
I said I'd go by myself.

09:28.986 --> 09:31.154
What an asshole!

09:32.197 --> 09:34.825
The guys are almost ready.
Just give them a minute.

09:35.575 --> 09:37.911
What a nice guy.

09:37.995 --> 09:39.538
He'll be kicking himself later.

09:44.042 --> 09:45.419
Don't be such a drama queen.

09:46.044 --> 09:48.213
-Woo-su!
-I hope it's not stuck to my forehead.

09:56.430 --> 09:57.306
Wait here.

10:12.654 --> 10:14.031
What a hottie!

10:15.449 --> 10:16.283
You were filming.

10:18.618 --> 10:21.204
-Sorry?
-I saw you. Delete it.

10:22.247 --> 10:23.081
I wasn't.

10:23.165 --> 10:25.625
I was just trying to see
if I had a bug on my face.

10:29.963 --> 10:32.924
I'm not the kind of person
who films people on the sly.

10:33.008 --> 10:34.676
I'll let you slide
if you apologize and delete it,

10:34.760 --> 10:35.719
so think wisely.

10:37.471 --> 10:38.805
But I wasn't filming you.

10:45.228 --> 10:47.230
-What's going on?
-She was filming us.

10:47.898 --> 10:50.025
Probably going to upload it
for the comments.

10:53.695 --> 10:55.072
ZERO COMMENTS

10:58.784 --> 11:00.535
For the comments?

11:02.120 --> 11:03.580
Yeah, comments!

11:03.663 --> 11:04.664
I'd love some comments.

11:04.748 --> 11:06.541
The more, the better.

11:06.625 --> 11:10.670
I didn't get a single snarky comment
despite the soapy ending.

11:10.754 --> 11:14.132
Do you know how humiliating it is
to have zero comments for 100 episodes?

11:16.510 --> 11:17.844
Don't change the subject.

11:19.096 --> 11:20.097
Give it a rest.

11:20.806 --> 11:21.640
You weren't filming?

11:22.224 --> 11:23.058
No.

11:24.101 --> 11:25.018
She said she wasn't.

11:25.102 --> 11:27.646
I saw her. Hiding like this.

11:28.855 --> 11:29.689
I want to check.

11:29.773 --> 11:31.566
What are you doing?

11:31.650 --> 11:33.777
-Let go.
-Don't do it.

11:33.860 --> 11:34.861
I didn't film you.

11:44.079 --> 11:45.747
No, no.

11:45.831 --> 11:48.458
No, please, no.

11:54.506 --> 11:57.134
The screen's cracked.
What are you going to do about this?

11:57.217 --> 11:59.052
How could you do this!

11:59.136 --> 12:00.178
I can't believe this!

12:00.262 --> 12:01.763
You should have just shown me.

12:03.223 --> 12:04.057
I'm sorry, kid.

12:04.141 --> 12:06.768
He's very sensitive about being filmed.

12:06.852 --> 12:08.728
That's why he overreacted.

12:08.812 --> 12:10.605
We'll compensate you for the damage.

12:13.275 --> 12:14.192
Forget it!

12:18.864 --> 12:20.699
Do you know why students wear uniforms?

12:25.162 --> 12:26.621
So they can be identified.

12:27.414 --> 12:31.501
If any footage of this turns up online,
I'll make you regret it.

12:34.713 --> 12:36.089
Asshole!

12:38.008 --> 12:38.842
Hey!

12:39.509 --> 12:40.635
Are you still here?

12:41.344 --> 12:43.221
Just get in and come with us
or we'll be late.

12:43.305 --> 12:44.514
Give me a second.

12:58.361 --> 12:59.696
Slow down.

13:24.804 --> 13:27.140
JEONJU MURIM GIRLS' HIGH

13:27.224 --> 13:33.188
CHAPTER 3:
SO, THAT ASSHOLE IS MY…

13:37.901 --> 13:39.903
Hey, Eui-ju!

13:42.030 --> 13:43.865
My best friend, Choi Go-ya.

13:43.949 --> 13:45.492
A gifted artist.

13:45.575 --> 13:49.120
She's been dating continuously
since sixth grade.

13:50.705 --> 13:54.125
I think I've put on two kilos.
All I did was eat and sleep.

13:56.836 --> 13:58.213
Yikes! What happened?

13:59.381 --> 14:01.049
Some guy moved in next door.

14:01.132 --> 14:03.718
He thought I was filming him
and asked to see my phone.

14:03.802 --> 14:05.428
I tried to stop him and…

14:06.846 --> 14:08.265
And you just let him be?

14:08.348 --> 14:12.060
You should have made him pay to repair it.
Or at least got his number to hound him.

14:12.143 --> 14:13.853
I didn't want any more to do with him.

14:13.937 --> 14:15.272
He looked like a complete jerk.

14:19.776 --> 14:21.111
What? Who is it?

14:21.903 --> 14:22.737
My ex.

14:23.363 --> 14:24.906
You broke up again?

14:24.990 --> 14:27.158
You said he was the hottest guy
at your art academy.

14:30.620 --> 14:33.039
When am I finally going to meet
my last love?

14:34.207 --> 14:35.750
Must be nice.

14:35.834 --> 14:37.586
I haven't even met my first love.

14:39.588 --> 14:41.131
Is the reason my novels are lame

14:41.756 --> 14:43.383
because I've never dated?

14:44.801 --> 14:45.802
Well…

14:46.553 --> 14:48.471
Dating might be helpful.

14:49.306 --> 14:51.766
But the more you do it,
the more it bursts your bubble.

14:53.059 --> 14:55.854
Since you still have
a rose-tinted view of dating,

14:55.937 --> 14:57.731
wouldn't that make you write better?

14:58.356 --> 15:00.442
-You think?
-Yeah.

15:00.525 --> 15:02.235
Why? Is it not going well?

15:02.319 --> 15:03.278
You said you were done.

15:04.029 --> 15:06.031
Yeah, I kind of am.

15:08.366 --> 15:10.535
When can I read it?

15:10.619 --> 15:12.495
You won't tell me the title
or your pen name.

15:13.371 --> 15:14.956
Are you sure we're friends?

15:15.040 --> 15:17.459
I told you I'm going to take it
to my grave.

15:19.628 --> 15:20.962
What if you hit the big time?

15:21.046 --> 15:22.922
Are you still going to keep it secret?

15:23.548 --> 15:24.424
The big time?

15:25.634 --> 15:29.304
You'll be the first one I tell.

15:29.387 --> 15:32.015
I would love it if that happened.

15:36.561 --> 15:37.812
Hey, Go-ya! Eui-ju!

15:37.896 --> 15:39.856
-Hey!
-What's going on?

15:39.939 --> 15:42.359
-What is it?
-Quickly!

15:42.859 --> 15:43.693
Quickly!

15:43.777 --> 15:45.695
Hey! Can you see?

15:45.779 --> 15:48.406
I heard it was happening and it did!

15:48.490 --> 15:50.742
Wow. All the new teachers are guys.

15:50.825 --> 15:52.952
And not just any old guys.

15:53.036 --> 15:55.038
They're complete hotties. Total studs.

15:55.121 --> 15:56.915
I can't believe it.

15:56.998 --> 15:57.957
Take a look.

15:58.041 --> 16:00.377
Those looks! Those bodies!

16:00.460 --> 16:02.212
I'm going crazy.

16:02.295 --> 16:05.590
I've never wanted to go into
the teachers' office so much.

16:05.674 --> 16:07.300
This is unbearable!

16:07.884 --> 16:10.303
But Young-hee's locked the door
so we can't get in.

16:10.929 --> 16:14.808
She's introducing the new teachers,
so why is she keeping them from us?

16:16.518 --> 16:17.852
PE, Jung Gi-jeon.

16:17.936 --> 16:18.978
JUNG GI-JEON

16:19.062 --> 16:20.355
He represented Korea.

16:20.438 --> 16:23.775
He was the first Korean to finish
fourth in the luge at the Winter Games.

16:24.567 --> 16:26.403
Damn it! Look at that body.

16:28.613 --> 16:31.116
Noh Da-ju. A polyglot.

16:31.199 --> 16:33.076
He'll teach Japanese and freshman English.

16:35.453 --> 16:38.665
He even did a TUD talk
on the secret to mastering languages.

16:39.833 --> 16:41.960
Rumor has it, he's the youngest son
of a chaebol family.

16:43.712 --> 16:45.463
I'm so glad I lived to see this.

16:51.177 --> 16:52.637
Korean literature, Yoon Dong-ju.

16:52.721 --> 16:56.558
Had a poem published
in Literary Youth in 2020.

16:56.641 --> 16:57.809
Something like My Mother.

17:00.019 --> 17:00.979
Found him.

17:02.897 --> 17:04.357
My last love.

17:06.651 --> 17:08.653
Hang on.

17:09.946 --> 17:11.531
That guy teaches Korean literature?

17:12.323 --> 17:13.366
Then surely not.

17:14.576 --> 17:15.410
No way.

17:16.035 --> 17:17.412
Ga Woo-su.

17:17.495 --> 17:18.997
Our new math teacher.

17:21.666 --> 17:26.671
Thanks to his outstanding research
in college…

17:26.755 --> 17:27.589
GA WOO-SU

17:27.672 --> 17:30.467
…several Ivy League schools
tried to recruit him,

17:31.176 --> 17:32.969
but he chose to come here instead.

17:36.473 --> 17:38.099
That asshole?

17:39.350 --> 17:41.060
He's a member of Mensa.

17:41.144 --> 17:42.187
Did you hear that?

17:43.229 --> 17:44.898
That's the kind of person he is.

17:44.981 --> 17:48.401
To put it another way, he's a math genius.

18:40.119 --> 18:41.746
Dropped my…

18:46.835 --> 18:48.503
Did you see?

18:48.586 --> 18:50.713
Da-ju is just my type.

18:50.797 --> 18:52.882
The age of Ha E-den is finally over.

18:52.966 --> 18:54.509
Hey, how can you even compare?

18:54.592 --> 18:57.262
Ha E-den was just a little cute.

18:58.680 --> 19:01.599
Are you talking about me?
This early in the morning?

19:02.892 --> 19:04.519
HA E-DEN
MUSIC TEACHER

19:06.437 --> 19:07.689
Not at all.

19:08.690 --> 19:11.025
Oh, Go-ya. That was cold. That hurt.

19:11.734 --> 19:14.362
Thank you for being
our temporary homeroom teacher.

19:14.904 --> 19:16.698
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

19:23.204 --> 19:24.539
-Hello, sir.
-Good morning.

19:24.622 --> 19:25.582
No, it's not good.

19:26.291 --> 19:28.543
Have they lost their minds all together?

19:33.840 --> 19:37.927
MURIM GIRLS' HIGH 11TH GRADE CLASS 2

19:39.846 --> 19:42.515
From now on, I'm going to put on
full make-up every day.

19:42.599 --> 19:44.309
Who have you got your eye on?

19:45.059 --> 19:46.936
His name is Dong-ju.

19:47.020 --> 19:48.229
My future husband.

19:49.314 --> 19:51.649
What should I major in
to be the perfect wife and mother?

19:51.733 --> 19:54.068
I think he'd like the quiet, modest type.

19:56.696 --> 19:58.781
I like the Japanese teacher.

19:58.865 --> 20:00.033
Get back to your lashes.

20:03.453 --> 20:04.996
-Who are you going for?
-For what?

20:05.079 --> 20:06.873
Your bias?

20:06.956 --> 20:07.957
We shouldn't overlap.

20:08.041 --> 20:10.460
Forget it. Bias? What a crock.

20:11.044 --> 20:13.379
But he's not even your type.

20:13.463 --> 20:14.672
My type's changed.

20:15.965 --> 20:17.342
Hang on a sec.

20:18.426 --> 20:20.845
-I just got a chill.
-Why?

20:20.929 --> 20:22.972
That means one of those four

20:23.598 --> 20:26.768
is going to be our new homeroom teacher.

20:29.896 --> 20:31.064
Shut up!

20:35.068 --> 20:38.029
EUN HA-SU
TOP OF THE SCHOOL, PRESENCE

20:38.571 --> 20:39.489
Will you be quiet?

20:42.116 --> 20:43.743
Class hasn't started yet.

20:43.826 --> 20:46.371
At least don't disturb others.

20:49.916 --> 20:51.292
She thinks she owns the place.

20:52.669 --> 20:54.003
Fancy a snack?

20:54.754 --> 20:55.922
Shall we pop out?

20:59.592 --> 21:00.593
Where are you going?

21:06.724 --> 21:08.643
BRACKET BY SPORT

21:08.726 --> 21:10.853
KOREAN LITERATURE TIMETABLE

21:10.937 --> 21:12.105
MR. GA WOO-SU

21:12.188 --> 21:15.441
MURIM GIRLS' HIGH
11TH GRADE TEACHERS' OFFICE

21:36.963 --> 21:39.298
KOREAN LITERATURE TIMETABLE

21:41.926 --> 21:43.428
Are you doing coloring?

21:45.054 --> 21:47.098
It's so I don't get confused.

21:52.478 --> 21:53.312
Are you feeling off?

21:53.980 --> 21:54.939
Want some antacids?

21:55.523 --> 21:58.026
No, I'll be fine.

22:17.211 --> 22:18.421
Are you disinfecting?

22:19.088 --> 22:20.298
Don't be so weird.

22:20.381 --> 22:21.340
Butt out.

22:23.551 --> 22:25.178
In the jungle of the workplace,

22:25.261 --> 22:27.597
don't you know standing out
means certain death?

22:28.264 --> 22:30.183
You know nothing
about the ways of the world.

22:30.808 --> 22:32.310
Switch with me. I can't take him.

22:32.393 --> 22:33.644
Don't be like that.

22:34.479 --> 22:36.856
I want to sit facing you.

22:36.939 --> 22:38.649
I miss you even when I can see you.

22:39.525 --> 22:41.819
Just stay there. It's designated seating.

22:41.903 --> 22:43.529
I don't want to sit facing that bat.

22:43.613 --> 22:44.739
What!

22:51.788 --> 22:53.414
I told you not to call me that.

22:54.540 --> 22:58.920
That word is like Voldemort to me.
I don't even want it on my lips.

22:59.003 --> 23:00.171
Don't you know I hate it?

23:00.963 --> 23:03.257
Of course you do. That's why you said it.

23:03.341 --> 23:06.177
You're Ga Woo-su, the genius.
There's no way you don't know.

23:09.639 --> 23:11.516
My hippocampus actually does something.

23:11.599 --> 23:14.811
It doesn't just handle learning
and memory, it also regulates emotions.

23:15.686 --> 23:17.396
That's why I can't sit facing you.

23:22.276 --> 23:24.112
Don't insult my hippocampus.

23:24.195 --> 23:25.613
You memory freak!

23:25.696 --> 23:26.864
Hey, fruit bat!

23:26.948 --> 23:28.074
What? Glasses monkey!

23:28.157 --> 23:29.117
Glasses monkey?

23:30.159 --> 23:31.494
Will you two cut it out?

23:38.209 --> 23:40.044
MURIM GIRLS' HIGH SCHOOL

23:40.128 --> 23:42.004
How do you know he's your last love?

23:42.088 --> 23:43.548
You only just met him.

23:45.883 --> 23:46.884
Love is…

23:47.969 --> 23:49.220
like the first snow.

23:49.303 --> 23:50.388
Love at first sight.

23:50.471 --> 23:51.597
When you see them,

23:53.015 --> 23:54.517
you know that person is meant for you.

23:55.601 --> 23:57.145
That's how it is, kiddo.

23:57.937 --> 24:00.231
It hits you when you least expect it.

24:02.817 --> 24:06.404
Then all those other guys you dated…

24:06.487 --> 24:08.239
None of them were your first snow?

24:09.323 --> 24:11.534
I thought they were,
but they were just frost.

24:13.911 --> 24:16.455
My first snow came today.

24:18.833 --> 24:21.127
When will I get my first snow?

24:22.587 --> 24:23.462
I told you.

24:24.213 --> 24:26.424
When you least expect it.

24:27.758 --> 24:28.718
Suddenly,

24:29.677 --> 24:31.012
when you're defenseless,

24:31.846 --> 24:33.890
-like a smack to the back of the head.
-Thank you.

24:33.973 --> 24:35.266
-Ouch!
-Bye.

24:37.560 --> 24:38.811
-How much?
-It's 2,000 won.

24:40.313 --> 24:41.981
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

24:42.773 --> 24:43.941
Lucky you.

24:44.025 --> 24:46.402
You're experiencing first snow
with the new teacher.

24:46.485 --> 24:48.404
Whereas my first meeting was a disaster.

24:49.405 --> 24:50.698
Whatever.

24:52.241 --> 24:53.826
Anyhow,

24:53.910 --> 24:55.453
that's why he mentioned uniforms.

24:55.536 --> 24:57.872
He was basically saying,
"I'll see you at school."

24:59.248 --> 25:02.668
What's the use in being a genius
if he has a shitty personality?

25:12.553 --> 25:13.554
What is it?

25:47.672 --> 25:49.215
NO WAY

25:49.298 --> 25:51.801
I'M YOUR HOMEROOM TEACHER

27:06.625 --> 27:08.627
Subtitle: Paul Carver
